[CODE]
/ce givebook Lino soul_siphon 3 100 0 1
/ce giveitem Lino arcane_dust 1 10 MYTHIC
/ce giveitem Lino soul_crystal 1 100
/ce random Lino RARE 3
[/CODE]

[SIZE=5][B]Rarities, sets and kits[/B][/SIZE]
Default rarities: COMMON, UNCOMMON, RARE, EPIC, MYTHIC, CELESTIAL.

Set IDs: wayfarer, vanguard, wraith, warden, monarch, glacier, stormborn. All four marked pieces must be worn in their correct slots. Weapon IDs: wayfarer_cleaver, vanguard_greataxe, vanguard_longsword, wraith_reaver, monarch_saber.

[SIZE=5][B]Configuration files[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]config.yml - rarities, prices, slot limits, tome destruction, excluded worlds, performance bounds, table tiers and loot pools.
[*]enchantments.yml - titles, summaries, applies-to materials, events, tiers, rate, delay, rules, prerequisites, incompatibilities and actions.
[*]equipment.yml - armor sets, special weapons, model data, lore, enchantments and set bonuses.
[*]kits.yml - kit contents and cooldowns.
[*]messages.yml - English messages and prefix.
[/LIST]

[CODE]
seraph_grace:
  title: Seraph Grace
  summary: Gradually mends your health after taking combat damage.
  rarity: EPIC
  events: [DEFEND_HIT, DEFEND_MOB]
  applies-to: [CHESTPLATES]
  tiers:
    1:
      rate: 15
      delay: 4
      actions:
        - restore_health | 2 -> self
[/CODE]

